issues.body:
## Problem
VIQR is the ASCII convention for writing Vietnamese with keyboard marks after the vowel (for example `Vie^.t Nam`). It still shows up in old mail archives, plain-text exports and some legacy systems. Agents garble it, and every other vn-skills tool (address, name, e-invoice) fails on such text.

A grep of `packages/core/src` for VIQR finds nothing; core only has `removeDiacritics` / `normalizeText` in `shared/diacritics.ts`. The npm package `vietnamese-conversion` (about 665 downloads a month) handles this, which shows the demand.

The convention is specified in RFC 1456 (Vietnamese Standardization Working Group, May 1993): https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc1456.txt. Build the mapping only from that RFC: tone and vowel mnemonics, the `DD`/`dd` rule, and the escape character and literal handling. Copy nothing from other libraries.

TCVN3 and VNI byte encodings are out of scope; no cited source for their tables exists in the repo.

## Proposed surface
- Core: `viqrToUnicode(text: string): Result<{ text: string; replaced: number; warnings: string[] }>` in `packages/core/src/text/` (or next to the vn-text code from #239 if that has merged). Exported from `src/index.ts`.
  - Output is NFC.
  - Non-string input returns `ok:false` with code `INVALID_INPUT` instead of throwing.
  - Empty input returns `EMPTY`.
  - Sequences the RFC marks as ambiguous or escaped are handled exactly as the RFC says. Cite the RFC section in a code comment.
- CLI: `vn-skills text from-viqr <text|->`. `-` reads stdin. JSON output when piped.
- MCP: `vn_text_from_viqr`, with a title and read-only/closed-world annotations like the other tools.
- This belongs to the `vn-text` skill from #239. If #239 has merged, extend its CLI command, MCP group and `skills/vn-text/SKILL.md`. If it has not, wait for it instead of creating a second `text` command.

## Acceptance
- [ ] ≥ 20 tests in `tests/text-viqr.test.ts`, covering:
  - every tone mark on a, e, i, o, u, y;
  - â, ê, ô, ă, ơ, ư with tones;
  - đ/Đ;
  - upper case;
  - the RFC's escape/literal handling;
  - text with no VIQR (unchanged);
  - mixed punctuation that is not a tone mark, per the RFC rules;
  - empty and non-string input;
  - the CLI with an argument and with stdin;
  - the MCP tool.
- [ ] Golden cases are added to the vn-text golden file in `tests/golden/`.
- [ ] `skills/vn-text/SKILL.md` gains trigger words such as "VIQR", "chuyển mã tiếng Việt" and "lỗi font chữ", and `tests/golden/triggers.json` is updated to match.
- [ ] README tool tables and counts are updated in `README.md` and `README.vi.md`.
- [ ] `pnpm build && pnpm typecheck && pnpm lint && pnpm exec vitest run && pnpm format:check` pass.

